# Cada bloque ### es un request distinto. Clic en Send Request en ESE bloque.

### Planilla de hoy
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cash/1/today

### Historial de planillas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cash/1/sessions

### Planilla de un día
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cash/1/sessions/2026-09-08

### Historial de movimientos
GET http://localhost:8080/api/cash/1/sessions/2026-09-08/movements

### Corregir movimiento
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/cash/1/movements/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movementType": "GASTO",
  "amount": 3500.00,
  "description": "era gasto, no vale"
}

### Borrar movimiento
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/cash/1/movements/2

### Recuento de apertura
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cash/1/sessions/2026-09-08/opening-count
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openingAmount": 45000.00
}

### Retiro por resguardo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cash/1/sessions/2026-09-08/withdrawals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 120000.00,
  "description": "A la caja"
}

### Vale
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cash/1/sessions/2026-09-08/vales
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000.00,
  "description": "vale Juan"
}

### Gasto
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cash/1/sessions/2026-09-08/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 120000.00,
  "description": "Proveedor de figus"
}

### Ingreso de efectivo
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cash/1/sessions/2026-09-08/cash-ins
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 200000.00,
  "description": "Ingresa el dueño"
}

### Cierre
POST http://localhost:8080/api/cash/1/sessions/2026-09-08/close
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "closingAmount": 15500.00,
  "note": "faltó un poco"
}
